  "description": "FAMHOS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H96 Dy8 N32 O44,10(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.958-3.997 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.98-116.97°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(μ4-CO3)4(L)8(H2O)8]·10MeOH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
